{"id":"0dfe9d10a9cb0e4f","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-free-variable.md","title":"自由变量、出现变量与全称闭包","display":"df-free-variable — 自由变量、出现变量与全称闭包","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-free-variable","aliases":["18-df-free-variable"],"display":"df-free-variable — 自由变量、出现变量与全称闭包","depends_on":["[[18-df-formula]]"],"source_correspondence":"本地依赖补全","local_revision":"2026-10-14","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked","content_revision":"2026-10-14","content_review_scope":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check","prior_revision_verification_status":"local-mathematical-reconstruction; not-machine-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-free-variable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-free-variable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-free-variable — 自由变量、出现变量与全称闭包"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2718a8a11c383b33\" href=\"?note=2718a8a11c383b33\" title=\"18-df-formula\">18-df-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"本地依赖补全"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked"},{"key":"content_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"content_review_scope","html":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"},{"key":"prior_revision_verification_status","html":"local-mathematical-reconstruction; not-machine-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2718a8a11c383b33\" href=\"?note=2718a8a11c383b33\" title=\"18-df-formula\">18-df-formula</a> 及其项和字母表依赖。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in C\">\\(c\\in C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in F_n\">\\(f\\in F_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in R_n\">\\(R\\in R_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 为公式，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_i\">\\(v_i\\)</span> 是签名中固定且无重复的变量枚举。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_S\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Occ}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Occ}_S\\)</span> 分别跟踪自由变量与全部出现变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BV}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BV}_S\\)</span> 只跟踪量词绑定位置，允许空绑定。</p>\n<p>同一递归模式也用于本册明确构造的有限多类语法：原子中各类变量均按其所在项计入，变量枚举取该语言指定的交错枚举；不把不同类的变量混同。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{All}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{All}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ucl}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ucl}_S\\)</span> 是公式构造函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall^*A\">\\(\\forall^*A\\)</span> 在使用点表示该语言的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ucl}_S(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{ucl}_S(A)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\">\\(\\vec x\\)</span> 为有限变量列，空前缀返回原式。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(B\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> 为有限集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{New}_S(B,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{New}_S(B,n)\\)</span> 返回按固定枚举选择的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个互异新变量。</p>\n<p>无下标的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV},\\mathrm{Occ},\\mathrm{BV}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV},\\mathrm{Occ},\\mathrm{BV}\\)</span> 只在已经固定的当前签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 上使用；下式给出这些缩写，不能据此把另一签名的公式视为本签名公式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FV}_S(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\},&amp;\\mathrm{FV}_S(c)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_S(f(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\mathrm{FV}_S(t_i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_S(t\\doteq u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_S(t)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_S(u),&amp;\n\\mathrm{FV}_S(R(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\mathrm{FV}_S(t_i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_S(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_S(A),&amp;\n\\mathrm{FV}_S(A\\circ B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_S(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_S(B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_S(QxA)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_S(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},&amp;\n\\mathrm{free}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_S(A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FV}_S(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\},&amp;\\mathrm{FV}_S(c)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_S(f(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\mathrm{FV}_S(t_i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_S(t\\doteq u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_S(t)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_S(u),&amp;\n\\mathrm{FV}_S(R(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i&lt;n}\\mathrm{FV}_S(t_i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_S(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_S(A),&amp;\n\\mathrm{FV}_S(A\\circ B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_S(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_S(B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_S(QxA)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_S(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},&amp;\n\\mathrm{free}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_S(A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BV}_S(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing &amp;&amp;(A\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S),\\\\\n\\mathrm{BV}_S(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BV}_S(A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{BV}_S(A\\circ B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BV}_S(A)\\cup\\mathrm{BV}_S(B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{BV}_S(QxA)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\}\\cup\\mathrm{BV}_S(A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Occ}_S(t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_S(t) &amp;&amp;(t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Occ}_S(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_S(A)\\cup\\mathrm{BV}_S(A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BV}_S(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varnothing &amp;&amp;(A\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S),\\\\\n\\mathrm{BV}_S(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BV}_S(A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{BV}_S(A\\circ B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BV}_S(A)\\cup\\mathrm{BV}_S(B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{BV}_S(QxA)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\}\\cup\\mathrm{BV}_S(A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Occ}_S(t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_S(t) &amp;&amp;(t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Occ}_S(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_S(A)\\cup\\mathrm{BV}_S(A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{All}_S(\\langle\\rangle,A)&amp;\\coloneqq A,\\\\\n\\mathrm{All}_S(\\langle x\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec y,A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall x\\,\\mathrm{All}_S(\\vec y,A),\\\\\nJ_S(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{i&lt;\\omega:v_i\\in\\mathrm{FV}_S(A)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{inc}(J)&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota\\vec i\\in\\omega^{|J|}\\;\n\\left(\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec i)=J\\land\\forall j&lt;k&lt;|J|\\;(i_j&lt;i_k)\\right)\n\\quad(J\\subseteq\\omega,\\ |J|&lt;\\omega),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ucl}_S(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{All}_S\n\\left(\\langle v_{\\mathrm{inc}(J_S(A))_j}:j&lt;|J_S(A)|\\rangle,A\\right),\\\\\n\\forall^*A&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ucl}_S(A),&amp;\n\\forall\\vec x\\,A&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{All}_S(\\vec x,A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{All}_S(\\langle\\rangle,A)&amp;\\coloneqq A,\\\\\n\\mathrm{All}_S(\\langle x\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec y,A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall x\\,\\mathrm{All}_S(\\vec y,A),\\\\\nJ_S(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{i&lt;\\omega:v_i\\in\\mathrm{FV}_S(A)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{inc}(J)&amp;\\coloneqq\\iota\\vec i\\in\\omega^{|J|}\\;\n\\left(\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec i)=J\\land\\forall j&lt;k&lt;|J|\\;(i_j&lt;i_k)\\right)\n\\quad(J\\subseteq\\omega,\\ |J|&lt;\\omega),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ucl}_S(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{All}_S\n\\left(\\langle v_{\\mathrm{inc}(J_S(A))_j}:j&lt;|J_S(A)|\\rangle,A\\right),\\\\\n\\forall^*A&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ucl}_S(A),&amp;\n\\forall\\vec x\\,A&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{All}_S(\\vec x,A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Some}_S(\\langle\\rangle,A)&amp;\\coloneqq A,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Some}_S(\\langle x\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec y,A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists x\\,\\mathrm{Some}_S(\\vec y,A),\\\\\n\\exists\\vec x\\,A&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Some}_S(\\vec x,A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{And}_S(\\langle\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\top_S,\\\\\n\\mathrm{And}_S(\\langle A\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec B)&amp;\\coloneqq A\\land\\mathrm{And}_S(\\vec B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{New}_S(B,0)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{New}_S(B,n+1)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{New}_S(B,n){}^\\frown\n\\left\\langle v_{\\min\\{i&lt;\\omega:v_i\\notin B\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{New}_S(B,n))\\}}\\right\\rangle\n\\quad(B\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\ |B|&lt;\\omega).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Some}_S(\\langle\\rangle,A)&amp;\\coloneqq A,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Some}_S(\\langle x\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec y,A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists x\\,\\mathrm{Some}_S(\\vec y,A),\\\\\n\\exists\\vec x\\,A&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Some}_S(\\vec x,A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{And}_S(\\langle\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\top_S,\\\\\n\\mathrm{And}_S(\\langle A\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec B)&amp;\\coloneqq A\\land\\mathrm{And}_S(\\vec B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{New}_S(B,0)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{New}_S(B,n+1)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{New}_S(B,n){}^\\frown\n\\left\\langle v_{\\min\\{i&lt;\\omega:v_i\\notin B\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{New}_S(B,n))\\}}\\right\\rangle\n\\quad(B\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\ |B|&lt;\\omega).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FV}(u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_S(u)\n&amp;&amp;\\bigl(u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\cup\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Occ}(u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Occ}_S(u)\n&amp;&amp;\\bigl(u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\cup\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{BV}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BV}_S(A)\n&amp;&amp;\\bigl(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FV}(u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_S(u)\n&amp;&amp;\\bigl(u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\cup\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Occ}(u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Occ}_S(u)\n&amp;&amp;\\bigl(u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\cup\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{BV}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BV}_S(A)\n&amp;&amp;\\bigl(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补齐原缺失 free-variable 文件，并把多个使用点所需的全称闭包集中在同一确定接口。变量集合有限、自然数有限子集的递增列唯一，因此闭包是唯一公式树，而非只确定到变量改名。出现变量另外记录空绑定，用于选择不冲突的新变量。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2718a8a11c383b33","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"2718a8a11c383b33","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$、$\\mathrm{Term}_S$、$\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 见 [[18-df-formula]] 及其项和字母表依赖。$x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S$，$c\\in C$，$f\\in F_n$，$R\\in R_n$，$A,B$ 为公式，$\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}$，$Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}$。$v_i$ 是签名中固定且无重复的变量枚举。$\\mathrm{FV}_S$ 和 $\\mathrm{Occ}_S$ 分别跟踪自由变量与全部出现变量；$\\mathrm{BV}_S$ 只跟踪量词绑定位置，允许空绑定。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in C","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in F_n","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in R_n","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}","display":false},{"tex":"v_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Occ}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BV}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{All}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ucl}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall^*A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ucl}_S(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{New}_S(B,n)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV},\\mathrm{Occ},\\mathrm{BV}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FV}_S(x)&\\coloneqq\\{x\\},&\\mathrm{FV}_S(c)&\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_S(f(\\vec t))&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i<n}\\mathrm{FV}_S(t_i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_S(t\\doteq u)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_S(t)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_S(u),&\n\\mathrm{FV}_S(R(\\vec t))&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i<n}\\mathrm{FV}_S(t_i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_S(\\neg A)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_S(A),&\n\\mathrm{FV}_S(A\\circ B)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_S(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_S(B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}_S(QxA)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_S(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},&\n\\mathrm{free}(A)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_S(A).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BV}_S(A)&\\coloneqq\\varnothing &&(A\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S),\\\\\n\\mathrm{BV}_S(\\neg A)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BV}_S(A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{BV}_S(A\\circ B)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BV}_S(A)\\cup\\mathrm{BV}_S(B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{BV}_S(QxA)&\\coloneqq\\{x\\}\\cup\\mathrm{BV}_S(A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Occ}_S(t)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_S(t) &&(t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Occ}_S(A)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_S(A)\\cup\\mathrm{BV}_S(A).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{All}_S(\\langle\\rangle,A)&\\coloneqq A,\\\\\n\\mathrm{All}_S(\\langle x\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec y,A)&\\coloneqq\\forall x\\,\\mathrm{All}_S(\\vec y,A),\\\\\nJ_S(A)&\\coloneqq\\{i<\\omega:v_i\\in\\mathrm{FV}_S(A)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{inc}(J)&\\coloneqq\\iota\\vec i\\in\\omega^{|J|}\\;\n\\left(\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec i)=J\\land\\forall j<k<|J|\\;(i_j<i_k)\\right)\n\\quad(J\\subseteq\\omega,\\ |J|<\\omega),\\\\\n\\mathrm{ucl}_S(A)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{All}_S\n\\left(\\langle v_{\\mathrm{inc}(J_S(A))_j}:j<|J_S(A)|\\rangle,A\\right),\\\\\n\\forall^*A&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{ucl}_S(A),&\n\\forall\\vec x\\,A&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{All}_S(\\vec x,A).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Some}_S(\\langle\\rangle,A)&\\coloneqq A,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Some}_S(\\langle x\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec y,A)&\\coloneqq\\exists x\\,\\mathrm{Some}_S(\\vec y,A),\\\\\n\\exists\\vec x\\,A&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Some}_S(\\vec x,A),\\\\\n\\mathrm{And}_S(\\langle\\rangle)&\\coloneqq\\top_S,\\\\\n\\mathrm{And}_S(\\langle A\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec B)&\\coloneqq A\\land\\mathrm{And}_S(\\vec B),\\\\\n\\mathrm{New}_S(B,0)&\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{New}_S(B,n+1)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{New}_S(B,n){}^\\frown\n\\left\\langle v_{\\min\\{i<\\omega:v_i\\notin B\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathrm{New}_S(B,n))\\}}\\right\\rangle\n\\quad(B\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var}_S,\\ |B|<\\omega).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FV}(u)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}_S(u)\n&&\\bigl(u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\cup\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Occ}(u)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Occ}_S(u)\n&&\\bigl(u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\cup\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{BV}(A)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BV}_S(A)\n&&\\bigl(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":4709,"backlinks":[{"id":"5108757a70d00b41","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{All}_1,\\mathrm{Some}_1$ 在有限集合变量列长度上递归，作用于算术矩阵和已加同类前缀的公式。$\\mathrm{inc}$ 取 [[18-df-free-variable]] 的有限自然数集合递增枚举。$I_1(F),\\vec X_F,\\mathrm{ucl}_1(F)$ 在下式定义；闭包恰绑定全部自由集合变量，顺序固定，不绑定数变量。$\\Pi^1_1,\\Sigma^1_1$ 为前束语法类，允许自由参数，不是轻面点集类。"},{"id":"6d3242aa1837d0b9","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"对 $\\mathsf J(F)$，新变量禁用集取下式 $B_\\in(F)$；对 $\\mathsf V_\\in(t,y)$，取 $B_\\in(t)\\cup\\mathrm{Occ}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(y)$。这两类跨语言调用先把源变量及关系参数映射到目标变量，不能直接使用源语言变量集合。各模板的局部绑定变量由本节末的等式指定；$\\mathrm{New}_S$ 取 [[18-df-free-variable]]。递归调用只把显式显示的自由参数传入，替换用 [[18-df-substitution-formula]] 的同时捕获规避替换。由此规定唯一的变量选择，不依赖“适当改名”。有限合取用 $\\mathrm{And}_S$，空合取用 $\\top_S$，有限量词列用 $\\mathrm{All}_S,\\mathrm{Some}_S$。$\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}$，$Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}$；有界量词在 PA 中按 $<$、在集合论中按 $\\in$ 展开。"},{"id":"24c0bc5331222e31","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5a148e8fcfeed406","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{free},\\mathrm{Occ},\\forall^*$ 使用 [[18-df-free-variable]] 的有限树递归；替换使用 [[18-df-substitution-formula]]，类型函数满足 $\\tau(v_i^0)=0,\\tau(v_i^1)=1$，成员原子按类型 $(0,1)$ 的关系应用处理，集合变量本身是第二类的项。$\\forall^*F$ 按 $v_0^0,v_0^1,v_1^0,v_1^1,\\ldots$ 的固定顺序，对 $F$ 的全部自由变量取各自类的全称闭包。"},{"id":"592fd98020c21e43","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 是 [[18-df-symbol-alphabet]] 的一阶签名，公式、替换与闭包见 [[18-df-formula]]、[[18-df-substitution-formula]]、[[18-df-free-variable]]。$F,G,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，$s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S$，$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S$。$b:\\mathcal B_S\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 是命题赋值；对 $\\mathrm{Bool}_b$，量化式整体作为命题基元，而不是读取对象结构。$[P]$ 表示元语言命题 $P$ 的 $0/1$ 指示值。"},{"id":"ee9a93363bcae359","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}(\\mathcal L)$ 是 [[18-df-formula]] 的一阶公式语法；$G[t/x]$ 使用 [[18-df-substitution-formula]]，$\\forall^*$ 使用 [[18-df-free-variable]] 的闭包。$S=j_1(\\mathsf S)$ 是后继符号，$0=\\mathfrak z$ 是数零常元。$T\\vdash F$ 在这些语言中使用 [[18-df-first-order-calculus]]。"},{"id":"fd63116e7f220f4d","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}$ 是 [[18-df-nt]] 的原始递归一阶算术语言；$\\mathcal L$ 是包含它的任意一阶关系扩展语言。语法按 [[18-df-formula]]，替换与自由变量分别按 [[18-df-substitution-formula]]、[[18-df-free-variable]]；此处公式集合是元理论的集合，公式构造子不是对象语言中的集合运算。"},{"id":"963197a11f1d0acc","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\forall^*F$ 表示按固定变量枚举对 $F$ 全部自由变量的全称闭包。各模式只取 Assertion 中列出的变量互异及 $z\\notin\\mathrm{Occ}(F)$ 条件，不进行隐含改名。$\\mathrm{FV},\\mathrm{Occ}$ 是 [[18-df-free-variable]] 在当前 $\\mathcal L$ 上的接口。"},{"id":"e391b202f09e2f43","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Delta_0$ 由下式定义；$\\mathrm{AtFml}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}$ 是 $\\mathcal L_\\in$ 原子公式集合；$\\forall x\\in y$ 和 $\\exists x\\in y$ 由下式展开；$\\mathrm{FV},\\mathrm{Occ},\\forall^*$ 与替换使用 [[18-df-free-variable]]、[[18-df-substitution-formula]]。有限推导使用 [[18-df-first-order-calculus]]。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-free-variable]]"},{"id":"fe2ed372063cc94a","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_{\\mathrm{PA}}$ 是下述 $L_{\\mathrm{PA}}$ 的语言签名；$L_{\\mathrm{PA}}$ 是含常元 $0,1$、二元函数 $+,\\cdot$ 与等号的一阶语言，$\\mathcal V$ 是其数变量族。$\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{PA}}}$ 为 [[18-df-formula]] 的公式族。$\\mathcal V=\\{x_i\\mid i<\\omega\\}$ 的枚举无重复。$\\mathrm{free}$ 是 [[18-df-free-variable]] 在 $S_{\\mathrm{PA}}$ 上的实例。$\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm{PA}}$ 与 $\\mathrm{UQ}_{\\mathrm{PA}}$ 由下式分别定义全称闭包和有限量词前缀构造。$F[t/x]$ 复用 [[18-df-substitution-formula]]，本节只用 $t=0$ 与 $t=x+1$，这两种实例不会发生捕获；$Sx$ 缩写 $x+1$。理论公理为下式的句子集合。$\\mathcal L$ 在 $\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\mathcal L)$ 中是 $L_{\\mathrm{PA}}$ 的关系扩张；该处闭包采用扩张签名的 $\\mathrm{ucl}_{\\mathcal L}$，替换仍按本地捕获规避接口。有限推导见 [[18-df-first-order-calculus]]。\n$F,G\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{PA}}}$，$v\\in\\mathcal V$，$\\vec w$ 为有限数变量列；$\\mathrm{UQ}_{\\mathrm{PA}}$ 在列长上递归。"},{"id":"ccb1a85e29ea0a39","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal L$ 是包含二元关系符号 $\\in$ 和逻辑等号的一阶签名，$\\mathcal L'$ 是保留其变量枚举、仅扩张非逻辑符号的签名。项和公式取 [[18-df-formula]] 及其上游；$\\mathrm{FV},\\mathrm{BV}$ 取 [[18-df-free-variable]]，在本节点一律实例化于 $\\mathcal L'$。旧公式通过同一有限树编码嵌入 $\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L'}$。"},{"id":"f74af78814931ea0","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal L$ 是包含 $\\in$ 和逻辑等号的一阶签名；公式、出现变量、新变量选择和捕获规避替换分别取 [[./18-df-formula]]、[[18-df-free-variable]]、[[18-df-substitution-formula]]。本节点所有操作均在同一签名 $\\mathcal L$ 上实例化。"},{"id":"20cb1a93869734ac","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S$ 见 [[18-df-formula]]；$\\mathrm{free}$ 为 [[18-df-free-variable]] 的自由变量函数在此一阶公式子集上的限制，变量集同为 $\\mathrm{Var}_S$。"},{"id":"d6572d061e706d93","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"语法和自由变量、出现变量、变量枚举见 [[18-df-formula]]、[[18-df-free-variable]]。$x,y$ 为数域或所用一阶域的变量，$t,u$ 为项，$F,G,H$ 为公式，$\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}$，$Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}$。单变量替换只在变量与项类型相同的输入上定义。省略下标时 $\\mathrm{FV},\\mathrm{Occ},\\mathrm{AtFml},\\mathrm{Term}$ 均取当前签名的相应集合或函数。单类语言的全部变量类型均为 $0$；多类使用点须给出 $\\tau:\\mathrm{Var}\\to J$，每类有无限多个变量，且将原子视为对相应类项的关系应用。$\\mathrm{fresh}_\\tau(B,y)$ 选取与 $y$ 同类、未在有限集合 $B$ 中出现的最小下标变量。"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-free-variable]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-34","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-free-variable|18-df-free-variable]]"}],"outgoing":["2718a8a11c383b33"]}